# Browser UI

Use [the INSPINIA 5.2.0 Bootstrap reference](../../docs/inspinia-dashboard-style.md) for layouts, theme configuration, tokens, and component states across public, account, workspace, and administration pages. Apply it to browser markup generated by Python as well.

For SCSS/shared asset changes, run `npm run build`. See `inspinia/static/AGENTS.md` for generated and vendored asset boundaries.
